{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GWHrz9vJiQMR4mj8Zv59Cc","type":"tool_result","content":"PLUGIN_SAME\nsame scripts/route_check.py\nsame scripts/tiiny_ctl.py\nsame scripts/tiiny-swap.sh\n.:\n./\n../\nexamples/\nIMPLEMENTATION.md\nPATTERN.md\nREADME.md\nscripts/\nskill/\n\nexamples:\n./\n../\ntiiny-router/\n\nscripts:\n./\n../\nroute_check.py\ntiiny_ctl.py\ntiiny-swap.sh\n\nskill:\n./\n../\nplugin/\nreferences/\nscripts/\nSKILL.md\ntemplates/\n.redeye:\n\n.scratch:\nhermes-plugin-package/\n\ndocs/adr:\n0001-npm-installs-a-single-hermes-user-plugin.md\n\ndocs/agents:\ndomain.md\nissue-tracker.md\ntriage-labels.md\n# Hermes Tiiny Router\n\nAn npm-distributed add-on for the Hermes agent harness that runs delegated\nsub-agents on a Tiiny appliance, routing each subtask to the model that fits\nits shape.\n\n## Language\n\n### Distribution\n\n**Package**:\nThe npm artifact that carries the routing backend, the controller and the\nskill, plus the installer that places them into a Hermes home.\n_Avoid_: plugin (for this meaning), module, bundle\n\n**Routing backend**:\nThe Hermes delegation provider that picks a model for each delegated task.\n_Avoid_: plugin, router plugin, delegation plugin\n\n**Controller**:\nThe command-line tool that plans a batch, locks the device, loads and\nevicts models, and releases the device.\n_Avoid_: lifecycle script, swap script, ctl\n\n**Skill**:\nThe instructions that tell a manager agent how to drive the controller and\ndelegate through the routing backend.\n_Avoid_: playbook, guide\nusage: route_check.py [-h]\n                      [--tier {browser,code,draft,general,index,research}]\n                      [--all] [--image JOB] [--alternatives]\n                      [--thinking {auto,on,off}]\n                      [goal]\nroute_check.py: error: a task goal is required (or use --all)\nEXIT 2","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e2664e1d-aeb9-469f-9400-36b0aa23aff2","uuid":"9